# Activity 1.1.1: Digital Doodle

## 🎯 Performance Objective
By the end of the lesson, students will understand how to store data in a variable, concatenate different data types, and develop algorithmic thinking. This will be accomplished by completing an app that allows a user to take a picture, draw on the picture, and erase it by shaking the device.

---

## 🤝 Do Now
You and your partner will complete this activity by working together. Make sure that you know your partner's name and at least one fun fact about them!

